# Fleet server registry (#1351/#1418) — host-specific, like .env. Copy
# fleet.config.example.json to fleet.config.json on each deployment; never
# commit the real file, or every checkout (including CI) picks it up by
# default and activates fleet routing against servers the environment can't
# actually reach.
/fleet.config.json

